<div class="beauty frame">
  <div class="block col-2-3">
    <header class="reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why beauty.</p>
      <h2>Why we made<br>it beautiful.</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="copy">
      <p class="reveal">
        Most AI hardware is a black plastic puck. It works, but it doesn't
        belong — not in your hand, not on your desk, not in your life.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal">
        AI is moving close to us. Onto our bodies. Into our homes. Beside the
        people we love. The objects we let in that near have to earn it — the
        way a wedding ring earns it, or a reading lamp, or a favorite coat.
        They stay because we want them to.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal closer">
        Fountain will join that company or it won't ship. Materials that age
        well. Weight that feels intentional. A finish that asks to be touched.
        Beauty, for us, isn't decoration — it's how a thing earns the right to
        stay close.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-meta);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  header h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.038em;
    line-height: 0.98;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(40px, 6vh, 56px);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .copy p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1.4em;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .copy .closer {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  [data-revealed="true"] header { transition-delay: 0ms; }
  [data-revealed="true"] .copy p:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 200ms; }
  [data-revealed="true"] .copy p:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 340ms; }
  [data-revealed="true"] .copy p:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 500ms; }
</style>
